# Keep the Docker build context lean and secret-free. node_modules are reinstalled
# in the build stage; builds/artifacts and any local .env (secrets) never ship.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.vite
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.playwright-mcp
**/*.log
ran-2026-08-17
